# Gitignored files copied into every agent worktree.
# Read by scripts/claude-worktree-create.sh (a WorktreeCreate hook replaces
# Claude Code's built-in .worktreeinclude handling).
#
# Default: copy nothing. Worktrees provision their own Convex deployment via
# scripts/init-worktree.sh, so secrets must be set explicitly per worktree
# (opt-in: copy .env.local manually, then let init-worktree strip Convex
# coordinates). Copying secret files by default spreads live keys.
